WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:01.700
With Turret P2P,

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:04.000
borrowers and lenders meet directly.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.120
Want to lend?

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.230
Choose the collateral,

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:09.200
loan amount, fixed interest, and duration.

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.920
Fund your offer with USDG.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.040
Want to borrow?

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.480
Compare funded offers.

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.800
Review the terms, lock your tokens,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:20.320
and receive USDG in your wallet.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.720
The loan clock starts when you accept.

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:24.890
Interest is fixed for the whole loan,

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.800
even if you repay early.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.360
Repay in full by the final deadline.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:32.000
The lender can withdraw principal and interest.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.480
You can withdraw your collateral.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:35.820
Miss the due date and the

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.600
24-hour grace period?

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:40.160
The lender can claim all your collateral.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.200
It could be worth more, or less, than the debt.

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:46.320
There are no price-triggered liquidations.

00:00:46.320 --> 00:00:48.160
The repayment deadline matters.

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:50.880
Two wallets. One agreed loan.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.560
That’s P2P with Turret.
